 & =\frac{1}{\pi}\Lambda_{\boldsymbol{k}}\delta\left(\omega_{0}-\epsilon\right)\chi''\left(\omega-\nu\right)\left[n_{B}\left(\omega-\nu\right)+n_{F}\left(-\nu\right)\right]
